OL,3,GNEWSADairy farmer calls for help to
OL,4,Aface climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said it
OL,8,Funderstood the challenges farmers faced
OL,9,Fand had put in extra support. It added
OL,10,Fa "new #65m drought package includes an
OL,11,Fextra #50m for Sustainable Farming
OL,12,FIncentive agreements for short and
OL,13,Flong-term resilience".
